 ## Configuration
+The catalog installer selects `user.wview_davisconsoleapi.schema` for the active `StdArchive.data_binding` only when that binding still uses WeeWX's default `weewx.schemas.wview_extended.schema`. It preserves custom schemas and does not alter existing database tables. For a custom schema, retain its Davis columns or select the supplied schema when creating a new archive.
+
 By default, the installer installs `davisconsoleapi` as a extension. 
 It runs during every archive interval and inserts data into the default SQL database.
 
